5 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 46 of those years. In 2025 that same pair ran just 3% of normal on the middle of the grids, while June to July hit 160%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 13609 at 20% of normal. Grid 13908 shows a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 43.6.</p>"}
